┌ Help — qry 0.1.0 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Global                                                     Results · Copy & search                                   │
│ ctrl-q               quit                                  ctrl-s     export the results to a file                   │
│ ctrl-z               suspend to the shell                  /          search the results                             │
│ F1                   show / hide the help                  y          copy the cell                                  │
│ ctrl-p               command palette                       Y          copy the row                                   │
│ Tab                  next pane                             n          next match                                     │
│ shift-Tab            previous pane                         N          previous match                                 │
│ ctrl-n               new connection                        ctrl-y     copy as…                                       │
│ ctrl-o               import connections                    Enter      inspect the value                              │
│ ctrl-/               show / hide the key hints             i          show / hide the inspector                      │
│ ctrl-↑               grow the editor                       Results · Other                                           │
│ ctrl-↓               shrink the editor                     ?          show / hide the help                           │
│ F11                  maximise the pane / restore           :          command palette                                │
│ ctrl-l               show the messages                     ctrl-c     cancel the query (copy when none runs)         │
│ Esc                  dismiss the message                   s          sort by the column                             │
│                                                            S          add the column to the sort                     │
│ Tree                                                       ctrl-g     go to a row                                    │
│ ?                    show / hide the help                  <          narrow the column                              │
│ :                    command palette                       >          widen the column                               │
│ n                    new connection                        =          reset the column widths                        │
│ e                    edit this connection                  F          freeze the first column                        │
│ D Del                forget this connection                A          fetch every row                                │
│ c                    duplicate this connection             J          show / hide the jobs                           │
│ k ↑                  up                                                                                              │
│ j ↓                  down                                  Inspector                                                 │
│ h ←                  left                                  ?          show / hide the help                           │
│ l →                  right                                 :          command palette                                │
│ PgUp                 up a page                             Esc        go to the results                              │
│ PgDn                 down a page                           k ↑        up                                             │
│ g g Home             to the top                            j ↓        down                                           │
│ G End                to the bottom                         h ←        left                                           │
│ Space                expand / collapse                     l →        right                                          │
│ Enter                connect / switch to its session       g g        to the top                                     │
│ shift-Enter          open another session on it            G          to the bottom                                  │
│ r                    refresh the node                      y          copy the cell                                  │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ run:  F5 statement  F8 all  ctrl-e selection  results:  / search  y copy cell  Y copy row  Enter inspect value       │
│ tree:  Enter connect  Space expand  e edit  D delete  / filter                                                       │
